      name: 'Uplifting trance',
      description: 'Euphoric trance subgenre built around 138 BPM grooves, soaring lead synths, major-key chord progressions, and cathartic breakdowns engineered for peak-time emotional release.',
      inDefinedTermSet: 'https://trance-nexus.com/glossary',
